hadiths[12]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1975","[AI-translation] ´ Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : us din jahannam layi jaye gi us ki satr hazaar baagein hun gi aur aik baag ko satr hazaar farishtay hun ge jo us ko kheench rahay hun ge (to kal farishtay jo jahannam ko kheench kar laayein ge chaar arab noe karor hue)"
"1976","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : ye tumhari aag jis ko aadmi roshan karta hai jahannam ki aag ke satr hisson mein se aik hissa hai logon ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Allah ki qasam ! yehi aag (Jalanay ko) kaafi thi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke wo to us se unhattar hissay zyada garam hai aur har hissa mein itni hi garmi hai"
"1977","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas baithay thay aik dhamaakay ki aawaz aayi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum jantay ho ke ye kiya hai ham ne arz kiya ke Allah aur us ka Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam khoob jantay hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ye aik pathar hai jo jahannam mein satr baras pehle phainka gaya tha wo ja raha tha ab us ki teh mein pahuncha hai (maazAllah jahannam itni gehri hai ke us ki choti se teh tak satr baras ki raah hai aur wo bhi us taiz harkat se jaisay pathar upar se neechay ko girta hai)"
"1978","[AI-translation] ´Numan bin Bashir (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : sab se halka azaab us ko ho ga (jis se) jo do jootiyan aur do tasmay aag ke pehnay ho ga us ka bheja us tarah ubale ga jis tarah handiya ubalti hai wo samjhay ga ke us se zyada sakht azaab kisi ko nahi hua halanke us ko sab se halka azaab ho ga"
"1979","[AI-translation] ´Samura bin Jundub (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : baaz ko jahannam ki aag takhnon tak pakare gi aur baaz ko ghutnon tak aur baaz ko kamarband tak aur baaz ko gardan ke nichlay hissay tak"
"1980","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jannat aur dozakh ne behes ki dozakh ne kaha ke mujh mein wo log aayein ge jo mutakabbir aur zor walay hain aur jannat ne kaha ke mujhe kiya hua ke mujh mein wohi log aayein ge jo logon mein naatawan hain aur un mein (duniya ke lihaaz) se gire paray hain aur aajiz hain (yani aksar yehi log hun ge) tab Allah Taala ne jannat se farmaya ke to meri rehmat hai mein tere saath apne bandon mein se jis par chahun ga rehmat karun ga aur dozakh se farmaya ke to mera azaab hai mein tere saath apne bandon mein se jis ko chahun ga azaab karun ga aur tum donon bhari jao gi pas dozakh us waqt na bhare gi (aur sair na ho gi) jab tak Allah Taala us mein apna paon rakh de ga wo kahay gi ke bas bas tab bhar jaye gi aur baaz hissay baaz se simat jayein ge pas Allah Taala apni makhlooqat mein se kisi par zulm na karay ga aur jannat ke liye doosri makhlooq paida karay ga"
"1981","[AI-translation] ´bin Shihab kehtay hain ke` mein ne Sa'eed bin Musayyab se suna wo kehtay thay ke Baheera wo janwar hai jis ka doodh dohna buton ke liye mauqoof kiya jata ke koi aadmi us janwar ka doodh na doh sakta tha aur Saa'iba wo hai jis ko apne maboodon ke naam par chhor detay thay ke us par koi bojh na laadtay thay aur bin Musayyab ne kaha ke Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mein ne Amr bin Amir Khuzaa'i ko dekha ke wo apni aantein jahannam mein kheench raha tha aur sab se pehle Saa'iba usi ne nikala tha"
"1982","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : kafir ka daant ya us ki kuchali Uhud pahar ke barabar ho gi aur us ki khaal ki motayi teen din ki masaafat ho gi (yani teen din tak chalnay ki masaafat par us ki khaal ki badboo pahunche ya us ki motayi itni ho gi jitna teen din mein safar kiya jaye)"
"1983","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : kafir ke donon kandhon ke baich mein taiz ro sawaar ke teen din ki masaafat ho gi"
"1984","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : dozakhiyon ki do qasamein hain jin ko mein ne nahi dekha aik to wo log jin ke paas bailon ki damon ki tarah ke koray hain wo logon ko us se maartay hain doosray wo aurtein jo pehanti hain magar nangi hain (yani satr ke laiq libaas nahi hain) seedhi raah se behkaanay wali khud behaknay wali aur un ke sar bakhti (oont ki aik qasam hai) oont ki kohaan ki tarah aik taraf jhukay hue wo jannat mein na jayein gi balke us ki khushbu bhi un ko na milay gi halanke jannat ki khushbu itni door se aa rahi ho gi"
"1985","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah usay suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke qareeb hai agar to dair tak jiya (zinda raha) to aisay logon ko dekhay ga aur wo Allah Taala ke ghussay mein subah karein ge aur Allah ke qehar mein shaam karein ge aur un ke haathon mein bail ki dam ki tarah ke (koray) hun ge"
"1986","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : qayamat ke din ahl dozakh mein se us shakhs ko laya jaye ga jo duniya mein sab se zyada aasooda tar aur khushhaal tha pas dozakh mein aik baar ghota diya jaye ga phir us se poocha jaye ga ke Ae Adam ke betay ! kiya to ne duniya mein kabhi aaraam dekha tha kiya tujh par kabhi chain bhi guzra tha wo kahay ga ke Allah ki qasam ! Ae mere Rab ! kabhi nahi aur ahl jannat mein se aik aisa shakhs laya jaye ga jo duniya mein sab logon se sakht tar takleef mein raha tha jannat mein aik baar ghota diya jaye ga phir us se poocha jaye ga ke Ae Adam ke betay ! to ne kabhi takleef bhi dekhi hai kiya tujh par shiddat aur ranj bhi guzra tha wo kahay ga ke Allah ki qasam ! mujh par to kabhi takleef nahi guzari aur mein ne to kabhi shiddat aur sakhti nahi dekhi"
